                                "sense_id": "dad1201c-c2da-343f-95af-be107d907be8",
                                "text": "After it is well rubbed and winnowed, you must then Ree it over in a fine Sieve , and if any of the Malt be uncleansed , then rub it again into the Sieve , 'till it be pure , and the rubbings will ariſe on the Top of the Sieve"
